  "title": "Petersen Museum Displays Mullin Family Foundation’s Gift of French Art Deco Cars",
  "summary": "The Petersen Automotive Museum has unveiled a new exhibit from the Mullin Collection. The cars, including coachbuilt rarities from Bugatti, Talbot-Lago, and Delahaye, were part of the Mullin Family Foundation’s gift to the Petersen following Peter Mullin’s 2023 passing and the closure of the Oxnard, California, museum founded by Peter and his wife, Merle, where […]",
